  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dd2380d2-c411-4a18-9f74-c1f6416f1fa8"],
 " is read as a 1-form; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraCodifferential"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraCodifferential", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "39503160-cef6-4576-929a-a6a132caed21"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraAntiderivative"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraAntiderivative", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ad675701-5cc2-434e-a320-f812e8b948ec"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraDerivative"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraDerivative", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8c463470-3c7c-4207-9942-6ddf6e493fd1"],
 " as 0-forms."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"db71a4df-1028-487e-af4a-a801d2de9ab6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Along a family of walks the integral is itself a multi-object, one value \
per member. ",
